body: "Research current Home Assistant 2026.8.1 developer documentation, tagged Core source, frontend client types, and live 2026.7.4 behavior. Implement typed auto-unsubscribing startup observation, capability/schema/help integration, and a setup wizard that emits one valid formatter payload in non-interactive mode while retaining interactive guidance. Keep credentials, endpoints, integration names, timing payloads, and topology outside Git and PM evidence."
